Package: yeastPainter
Title: Shiny App for painting yeast protein structures by fold change.
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Nikeisha",
           family = "Caruana",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "nikeisha.caruana@unimelb.edu.au")
Description: Colours the chains of a PDB structure by log2 fold change,
    resolving Saccharomyces cerevisiae gene names, systematic ORF names and
    UniProt accessions against the reviewed S288C proteome.
